1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,080
Imagine you threw away your nail clippers

2
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:02,720
forever.

3
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,880
Most people think nails just sit there,

4
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,000
like little shields.

5
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,600
But they're growing right now,

6
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,200
pushed out from a root hidden under

7
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:09,920
your skin.

8
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:11,840
New cells fill with keratin,

9
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:13,520
the same tough stuff as hair,

10
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:15,360
then die and slide forward.

11
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:16,880
Skip trimming for a year,

12
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:18,240
and they'd stick out half as long

13
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:19,120
as your fingers.

14
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:20,560
And they wouldn't grow straight.

15
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,720
They'd curl and twist into spirals.

16
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:24,480
They'd turn heavy and brittle,

17
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:25,680
and picking up a cup would be

18
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:26,320
a struggle.

19
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:27,760
If they never snapped,

20
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:29,680
after a lifetime each nail could be

21
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:30,880
longer than you are tall.

22
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:32,720
So that little click of the clippers?

23
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:34,971
It's keeping your hands working.
